It creates a sense of control over all the things swirling in my head all the time.
它让我对脑海中不断涌现的各种琐事产生了一种掌控感。

1109
00:50:16.340 --> 00:50:16.500
Yeah.
没错。

1110
00:50:17.080 --> 00:50:21.540
This article went on to say that lists can make you feel grounded, calm, and clear when
这篇文章还提到，当你感到不知所措时，

