00:50:21.540 --> 00:50:22.980
you otherwise feel overwhelmed.
列清单能让你感到踏实、冷静和思路清晰。

1112
00:50:24.000 --> 00:50:28.940
Lastly, in looking up why people love to make lists, I did stumble across the origin of the
最后，在探究人们为何热衷于列清单时，我偶然发现了

1113
