00:52:16.360 --> 00:52:16.760
Do not.
千万别。

1149
00:52:17.020 --> 00:52:22.080
All of you Shakespeare nerds out there, do not tell her that it was lawless resolutes.
你们这些莎士比亚书呆子，别去告诉她那是“lawless”。

1150
00:52:22.180 --> 00:52:23.460
It was landless resolutes.
那是“landless”。

1151
00:52:23.460 --> 00:52:28.980
It was, and it was a typo, and it was printed lawless, which actually changed the meaning of
确实是这样，而且那是个印刷错误，印成了“无法无天”，这实际上改变了

1152
00:52:28.980 --> 00:52:30.100
those terms as well.
那些条款的含义。

1153
00:52:30.420 --> 00:52:34.740
Anyway, myshakespeare.com, for those of you that love Shakespeare, wonderful website.
总之，myshakespeare.com，对于那些热爱莎士比亚的人来说，是个很棒的网站。

