1160
00:52:54.060 --> 00:52:56.060
I love literature, you guys.
伙计们，我热爱文学。

1161
00:52:56.240 --> 00:52:57.880
I love literature, and I love history.
我热爱文学，也热爱历史。

1162
00:52:59.020 --> 00:52:59.600
Okay.
